      ],
      "heading": null,
      "bodyHtml": "<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">JaxiCloud offers an integrated solution for reporting drivers’ driving, working and rest times from the tachograph and driver card. It ensures that you always pay the correct salary and that drivers comply with driving and rest time regulations. It also helps you keep your fleet optimized.</span></p><p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Jaxicloud web application offers a user-friendly dashboard where customers can effortlessly track their drivers’ status in real-time, whether they are online or offline, complete with detailed information such as slot numbers, connected devices, location and ddd file report.</span></p><p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">The app also shows when drivers were last connected to a vehicle within the last 30 days.</span></p>",
      "bodyText": "JaxiCloud offers an integrated solution for reporting drivers’ driving, working and rest times from the tachograph and driver card. It ensures that you always pay the correct salary and that drivers comply with driving and rest time regulations. It also helps you keep your fleet optimized.Jaxicloud web application offers a user-friendly dashboard where customers can effortlessly track their drivers’ status in real-time, whether they are online or offline, complete with detailed information such as slot numbers, connected devices, location and ddd file report.The app also shows when drivers were last connected to a vehicle within the last 30 days.",
