        "elementor-widget-text-editor"
      ],
      "heading": null,
      "bodyHtml": "<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">New opportunities to work with </span><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">tachographs</span></p><p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Tachograph regulations aimed at helping enforce driving time regulations </span><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">and monitor driving times for professionals, has had a major impact on the fleet management industry. And </span><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">as the work with digital tachographs has ensured the more accurate recording and storage of data, </span><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Jaxicloud Fleet Management now developed the function for remote data transfer from tachographs to </span><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Jaxicloud Fleet Management. A step further was the development of other 2 tools, aimed at </span><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">improve the work of integrators within one system</span></p><p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Tacho Manager app</span></p><p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Jaxicloud Fleet Management customers can now enjoy the benefits of the Tacho Manager app, which brings new benefits to the work of operators in international trucking and freight business. The application shows activity for each available trip, such as distance, speed and driving times and rest periods for the driver, these files are parsed and linked to drivers in Jaxicloud Fleet Management and can be uploaded manually via Tacho Manager.</span></p>",
      "bodyText": "New opportunities to work with tachographsTachograph regulations aimed at helping enforce driving time regulations and monitor driving times for professionals, has had a major impact on the fleet management industry. And as the work with digital tachographs has ensured the more accurate recording and storage of data, Jaxicloud Fleet Management now developed the function for remote data transfer from tachographs to Jaxicloud Fleet Management. A step further was the development of other 2 tools, aimed at improve the work of integrators within one systemTacho Manager appJaxicloud Fleet Management customers can now enjoy the benefits of the Tacho Manager app, which brings new benefits to the work of operators in international trucking and freight business. The application shows activity for each available trip, such as distance, speed and driving times and rest periods for the driver, these files are parsed and linked to drivers in Jaxicloud Fleet Management and can be uploaded manually via Tacho Manager.",
