      "heading": null,
      "bodyHtml": "<p>The files are automatically uploaded via the GPS tracker. This new tool is now supported by several devices, including the controllers from ITD, and several others. Files are saved and uploaded by the Disketta application. The program interface has been simplified to the download bar and the list of files to help the sender with relevant information.</p>",
