    {
      "id": "block-11",
      "order": 10,
      "sectionIndex": 3,
      "elementorId": "60a424b",
      "widgetType": "text-editor.default",
      "classes": [
        "elementor-element",
        "elementor-element-60a424b",
        "elementor-widget",
        "elementor-widget-text-editor"
      ],
      "heading": null,
      "bodyHtml": "<p class=\"font_9 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">After taking into account the AETR and EU specifications, Gurtam has released another app called&nbsp;Tacho View&nbsp;, which will be based on specifications for international road transport standards.&nbsp;Tacho View&nbsp;processes data received from tachograph files. It allows reflecting the driver’s activity based on a so-called “timeline” for better visual analysis. The app displays driving times and rest times for the registered driver. You can use a calendar (on the right side) to select the required date. The calendar can also be scaled as needed.</span></p>",
      "bodyText": "After taking into account the AETR and EU specifications, Gurtam has released another app called Tacho View , which will be based on specifications for international road transport standards. Tacho View processes data received from tachograph files. It allows reflecting the driver’s activity based on a so-called “timeline” for better visual analysis. The app displays driving times and rest times for the registered driver. You can use a calendar (on the right side) to select the required date. The calendar can also be scaled as needed.",
