      "heading": null,
      "bodyHtml": "<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">The entries are evaluated in the following way: • “Driver activity” . The information is displayed in a table. By selecting the required date, the user can see the detailed driver activity over the specified period. • “Activity chart” . The selected period is divided into days, where the information is displayed in charts (markers correlate with certain activity characteristics).</span></p>",
      "bodyText": "The entries are evaluated in the following way: • “Driver activity” . The information is displayed in a table. By selecting the required date, the user can see the detailed driver activity over the specified period. • “Activity chart” . The selected period is divided into days, where the information is displayed in charts (markers correlate with certain activity characteristics).",
