      "bodyHtml": "<p class=\"font_7 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">The entries can be printed in the form of a report directly from the app. In the near future, Tacho View will include specifications for all countries where tachograph regulations are present. And as manufacturers improve their technologies every year by making tachographs easier to use, we hope that our contribution stimulates practice and guarantees fair competition and international road safety.</span></p>",
